{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And this is the blessing with which Moses blessed.</b> Rabbi Yosef Kara explains that therefore it wrote 'the man of Elohim' — to say that at the word of the Holy One, blessed be He, he blessed them." "<b>Before his death.</b> Our Rabbis said: At the hour when the Angel of Death came to take the soul of Moses, Moses seized him and bound him, and blessed the tribes, each and every one with its blessing, before him."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:58.551508872Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}